IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `il41-nouns`

-- CHAPTER A, ss 1 to 5 (opinions).  Row IL-41.  Seat: the individual (NOTES.md section 1); the second layer, `il41-seat-recipient.l4`, is the recipient of an opinion.
-- Rulings of 2026-11-04 and 2026-11-05 followed: a flat negative and a "means" definition answer FALSE; an unclosed list, silence and a scope limit with no "only" answer NOTHING.

§ `Chapter A: opinions`

§§ `Section 1: definitions`

-- "the executive authority": the Government and all components of the executive authority that are not incorporated.  A "means" definition: a body outside it answers FALSE.
-- Not decided by the text: whether a holder of judicial power inside the executive is a component (s 5(a)(1) says "even if he is counted with the executive authority").
-- lsh:16 | "הרשות המבצעת" – הממשלה וכל גורמי הרשות המבצעת שאינם מאוגדים;
@ref Law s 1 "the executive authority"
GIVEN kind IS A `A kind of body`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`a body is part of the executive authority` kind MEANS
    CONSIDER kind
        WHEN `the Government`                                          THEN JUST TRUE
        WHEN `a minister`                                              THEN JUST TRUE
        WHEN `the Minister of Justice`                                 THEN JUST TRUE
        WHEN `a unit of the executive that is not incorporated`        THEN JUST TRUE
        WHEN `an incorporated body`                                    THEN JUST FALSE
        WHEN `a holder of judicial or quasi-judicial power`            THEN NOTHING
        WHEN `a court`                                                 THEN JUST FALSE
        WHEN `the Knesset`                                             THEN JUST FALSE
        WHEN `another body of the State outside the executive`         THEN JUST FALSE

-- "court": whoever holds judicial power, the High Court of Justice included.
-- lsh:13 | "בית משפט" – מי שנתונה בידו סמכות שפיטה, לרבות בית המשפט הגבוה לצדק;
@ref Law s 1 "court"
GIVEN kind IS A `A kind of body`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`a body is a court within s 1` kind MEANS
    CONSIDER kind
        WHEN `a court`                                                 THEN JUST TRUE
        WHEN `a holder of judicial or quasi-judicial power`            THEN NOTHING
        WHEN `the Government`                                          THEN JUST FALSE
        WHEN `a minister`                                              THEN JUST FALSE
        WHEN `the Minister of Justice`                                 THEN JUST FALSE
        WHEN `a unit of the executive that is not incorporated`        THEN JUST FALSE
        WHEN `an incorporated body`                                    THEN JUST FALSE
        WHEN `the Knesset`                                             THEN JUST FALSE
        WHEN `another body of the State outside the executive`         THEN JUST FALSE

-- "the Minister" is the Minister of Justice.
-- lsh:19 | "השר" – שר המשפטים.
@ref Law s 1 "the Minister"
GIVEN kind IS A `A kind of body`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`a body is the Minister of s 1` kind MEANS kind EQUALS `the Minister of Justice`

§§ `Section 3(b): the form of an opinion`

-- lsh:34 | (ב)	חוות דעת תינתן בכתב, אולם יכול שתינתן בעל פה אם היועץ המשפטי לממשלה סבור כי יש טעם בכך.
@ref Law s 3(b)
GIVEN `the Attorney General considers there is reason to give the opinion orally` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 3(b) permits an opinion to be given orally` MEANS `the Attorney General considers there is reason to give the opinion orally`

§§ `Sections 4 and 5: the force of a written opinion`

-- Section 4 binds only a written opinion on the existing law, and speaks to the components of the executive authority.  Section 5(a)(1) frees a holder of judicial or
-- quasi-judicial power; 5(a)(2) lets the Government decide that it, or anyone s 4 binds, need not follow the opinion; 5(c)(1) takes the criminal-law domain out of 5(a)(2);
-- 5(c)(2) says the exercise of a power an enactment gave the Attorney General is not treated as giving an opinion for s 4 and 5(a)(2).
-- JUST TRUE: the body must see the opinion as stating the existing law.  JUST FALSE: it need not.  NOTHING: ss 4 and 5 do not decide.
-- The "criminal-law domain" is taken as an input the person states.
-- lsh:37 | בכפוף להוראות סעיף 5, חוות דעת משפטית בכתב שנתן היועץ המשפטי לממשלה בדבר הדין הקיים, יראו אותה גורמי הרשות המבצעת כמשקפת את הדין הקיים; אין במתן חוות דעת כאמור כדי לשנות את הדין שהיה בתוקף ערב מתן חוות הדעת.
-- lsh:40 | (א)	על אף האמור בסעיף 4, אלה אינם חייבים לראות את חוות דעתו של היועץ המשפטי לממשלה כמשקפת את הדין הקיים:
-- lsh:44 | (1)	גורם המפעיל סמכות שיפוטית או מעין שיפוטית לפי כל דין, אף אם הוא נמנה עם הרשות המבצעת;
-- lsh:48 | (2)	הממשלה בהחלטתה, אם ראתה טעם בכך, וכן רשאית היא לפטור בהחלטתה כל מי שהוראות סעיף 4 חלות עליו מהחובה האמורה.
-- lsh:55 | (1)	הוראות סעיף קטן (א)(2) לא יחולו לעניין הפעלת סמכויות בתחום המשפט הפלילי.
-- lsh:59 | (2)	לא יראו הפעלת סמכות שהוקנתה ליועץ המשפטי לממשלה בחיקוק כמתן חוות דעת לעניין סעיף 4 ולעניין סעיף קטן (א)(2).
@ref Law ss 4, 5(a)(1), 5(a)(2), 5(c)(1), 5(c)(2), 18
GIVEN kind IS A `A kind of body`
      `the opinion is in writing` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the opinion is about the existing law` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the opinion is the exercise of a power an enactment gave the Attorney General` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the matter is the exercise of powers in the criminal-law domain` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Government has decided under s 5(a)(2) that this body need not` IS A BOOLEAN
      day IS A DATE
      commencement IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 4 makes the body see the opinion as stating the existing law` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF day LESS THAN commencement                                                         THEN NOTHING
        IF NOT `the opinion is in writing`                                                    THEN NOTHING
        IF NOT `the opinion is about the existing law`                                        THEN NOTHING
        IF `the opinion is the exercise of a power an enactment gave the Attorney General`    THEN NOTHING
        IF kind EQUALS `a holder of judicial or quasi-judicial power`                         THEN JUST FALSE
        IF NOT (`a body is part of the executive authority` kind EQUALS JUST TRUE)            THEN NOTHING
        IF `the matter is the exercise of powers in the criminal-law domain`                  THEN JUST TRUE
        IF `the Government has decided under s 5(a)(2) that this body need not`               THEN JUST FALSE
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

§§ `Section 5(b): where the Government lays a decision not to follow an opinion`

-- lsh:51 | (ב)	החליטה הממשלה כאמור בסעיף קטן (א)(2), תניח את החלטתה על שולחן ועדת החוקה, חוק ומשפט של הכנסת בצירוף חוות הדעת של היועץ המשפטי לממשלה הנוגעת לעניין, או על שולחן ועדת החוץ והביטחון של הכנסת – אם חוות הדעת נוגעת לענייני ביטחון המדינה או יחסי החוץ שלה.
@ref Law s 5(b); NOTES.md fork F4
GIVEN `the opinion concerns the security of the State or its foreign relations` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A Knesset committee`
`the committee on whose table s 5(b) says the Government lays its decision` `the opinion concerns the security of the State or its foreign relations` MEANS
    IF `the opinion concerns the security of the State or its foreign relations`
    THEN `the Foreign Affairs and Defense Committee`
    ELSE `the Constitution, Law and Justice Committee`
